# 仅本机示例。先用独立浏览器会话或安全工具注入 Cookie/CSRF，勿写入仓库。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:4180/api/ops/v1
# quoteId/orderId/receiptId/allocationId/accountId/feeId 均取当前响应。
# 每个请求用自己的幂等键，重试原样保留；审核更换独立身份。

### 经办：记录客户同意
POST {{base}}/quotes/{{quoteId}}/actions/record-customer-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{confirmationKey}}
If-Match: "1"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"customerContact":"DEMO sender","method":"MESSAGE","reference":"DEMO acceptance","confirmedAt":"{{confirmedAt}}"}

### 可用收款账户
GET {{base}}/finance/receiving-accounts

### 经办：申报（订单版本取当前 GET）
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/prepayment-receipts
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{receiptKey}}
If-Match: "{{orderVersion}}"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"receivingAccountId":"{{accountId}}","money":{"amountMinor":300,"currency":"USD"},"bankReference":"{{bankReference}}","reference":"DEMO bank evidence","observedAt":"{{observedAt}}"}

### 财务核验
POST {{base}}/prepayment-receipts/{{receiptId}}/actions/verify
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{verifyKey}}
If-Match: "1"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"approve":true,"reason":"DEMO independent bank check"}

### 经办：部分核销
POST {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/prepayment-allocations
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{allocationKey}}
If-Match: "{{orderVersion}}"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"receiptId":"{{receiptId}}","lines":[{"feeId":"{{feeId}}","amountMinor":100}],"reason":"DEMO allocation"}

### 复核（非经办）
POST {{base}}/prepayment-allocations/{{allocationId}}/actions/review
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{reviewKey}}
If-Match: "1"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"approve":true,"reason":"DEMO review"}

### 审批（非经办、非复核）
POST {{base}}/prepayment-allocations/{{allocationId}}/actions/approve
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{approveKey}}
If-Match: "2"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"approve":true,"reason":"DEMO approval"}

### 账务入账，不对外划款
POST {{base}}/prepayment-allocations/{{allocationId}}/actions/post
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{postKey}}
If-Match: "3"
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"reason":"DEMO posting"}

### 准入只读检查，不等于派单
GET {{base}}/orders/{{orderId}}/payment-admission
